        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-87001, Back-to-Back Freestone Front Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Freestone Front Door Pull Set comes packaged as a set of 2 door pulls to be mounted on a back-to-back on a single door that is 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. The Freestone Door Pull Pair is available in several of the most popular finish colors including oil rubbed bronze, satin brass, and polished chrome. The square grip grants this Freestone Back-to-Back Handle Pair a modern feel, making it a great choice for transitional decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/freestone-door-handle-emtek-87001\"><b>Freestone Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Back-to-Back Freestone Front Door Handle Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with (2) door pulls,  (2) 2-1/2\" #10-32 screws, and (2) #10-32 set screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-87001-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Freestone Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-87001:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-BTB-87002:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 11/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
